     "type": "tip",
     "tag": "Language focus",
     "title": "Three steps for every order",
     "steps": [
      [
       "1 · repeat",
       "Pilot: <b>Port ten.</b> → You: <b>Port ten.</b>"
      ],
      [
       "2 · do it",
       "Turn the wheel. Watch the rudder angle indicator."
      ],
      [
       "3 · report",
       "<b>Wheel is port ten.</b> · <b>Wheel is amidships.</b> · <b>Steady on zero four five.</b>"
      ]
     ],
     "paras": [
      "The repeat is called the <b>read-back</b>: it proves you heard the right order. Exactly the same words, nothing more.",
      "Courses are said figure by figure: <b>zero four five</b>, <b>one two zero</b>. Angles of rudder: <b>port ten</b>, <b>starboard twenty</b>, <b>hard-a-port</b>."
     ],
     "avoid": "OK · Yes, sir · forty-five"
    },
